#=============Turf========

#api call for listing turf
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/turf/
Accept: application/json

###api call for adding turf
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/turf/
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "id":4,
    "name":"Anfield",
    "location":"kunnamkulam,thrissur,pottore",
    "address":"Anfield,kunnamkulam,thrissur",
    "description":"soil ground 360",
    "opening_time":"05:00",
    "closing_time":"12:45",
    "day_price":700,
    "night_price":1700,
    "facilities":"parking,rest room,ground boy support"
    

}

